      "created_at": "2021-06-17T20:15:32.106Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The funny thing (aside from this reply being the first reply in 2.5 months since you posted it) is that if you inspect the icons that are working…</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/8/183574a15f70d2afb5b689de912ad3bbf2e62f74.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3s9ZdpaIXXh3v2QC0ypFtotlXQ8\" width=\"414\" height=\"325\"></p>\n<p>and use the name of that icon that is working… “crm” in this case…</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/c/4c8f61c17e2fc4298c5610b541bc9d72e4e7a6d8.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"aVhtSGRJ0dN2RLIjNLsZBQUPolW\" width=\"309\" height=\"81\"></p>\n<p>it still will not show an icon for your module.</p>\n<p>Here you see I have “crm” set as the icon… but still nothing:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/8/c8fad562a81af9bda040cedbae2c75c313b5fb33.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"sFWTX4kwzLEpHVueutli6rEZFwn\" width=\"456\" height=\"307\"></p>\n<p>A few other posts like this on the forum. No clear answer that I’ve found.</p>",
