      "id": 290108,
      "username": "brian_pond",
      "name": "Brian Pond",
      "created_at": "2021-06-17T21:26:48.123Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’ve encountered this issue also.</p>\n<p>From what I can tell, the available icons are <em>hard-coded</em> in this SVG file:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">.../apps/frappe/frappe/public/icons/timeless/symbol-defs.svg\n</code></pre>\n<p>So you cannot use any Feather icon.  You can only use icons defined in this file.</p>\n<p>The “book” icon is not one of them.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/brian_pond/{size}/93569_2.png",
      "trust_level": 3,
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
