    {
      "id": 290110,
      "username": "jpuser",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2021-06-17T21:46:11.209Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"brian_pond\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"73553\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/brian_pond/48/93569_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> brian_pond:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’ve encountered this issue also.</p>\n<p>From what I can tell, the available icons are <em>hard-coded</em> in this SVG file:</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes it looks like my “crm” test worked too (it’s in the .svg list you mentioned).  So there must be some cache or delay in displaying the icon. I wonder how to flush the cache.  I’ve tried bench restart, but that didn’t do it.</p>",
