    {
      "id": 312028,
      "username": "uzair",
      "name": "Uzzair Hasan",
      "created_at": "2022-01-20T10:36:01.938Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can add any svg path with</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;svg&gt; &lt;symbol viewBox=\"0 0 x y\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" id=\"icon-name\"&gt;&lt;path&gt;&lt;/path&gt; &lt;/symbol&gt;   &lt;/svg&gt; parent tags.\n</code></pre>\n<p>Run bench build and clear-cache commands. Hard Refresh your browser.</p>\n<p>Assign the new icon to a module using Customise Workbench feature.</p>\n<p>Hope this helps someone.</p>",
