      "username": "imbra",
      "name": "Abraham Kalungi",
      "created_at": "2023-08-11T14:20:13.782Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is for custome icons.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox githubpullrequest\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/pull/22000\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/pull/22000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com/frappe/frappe</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"github-icon-container\" title=\"Pull Request\">\n      <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"github-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M11 11.28V5c-.03-.78-.34-1.47-.94-2.06C9.46 2.35 8.78 2.03 8 2H7V0L4 3l3 3V4h1c.27.02.48.11.69.31.21.2.3.42.31.69v6.28A1.993 1.993 0 0 0 10 15a1.993 1.993 0 0 0 1-3.72zm-1 2.92c-.66 0-1.2-.55-1.2-1.2 0-.65.55-1.2 1.2-1.2.65 0 1.2.55 1.2 1.2 0 .65-.55 1.2-1.2 1.2zM4 3c0-1.11-.89-2-2-2a1.993 1.993 0 0 0-1 3.72v6.56A1.993 1.993 0 0 0 2 15a1.993 1.993 0 0 0 1-3.72V4.72c.59-.34 1-.98 1-1.72zm-.8 10c0 .66-.55 1.2-1.2 1.2-.65 0-1.2-.55-1.2-1.2 0-.65.55-1.2 1.2-1.2.65 0 1.2.55 1.2 1.2zM2 4.2C1.34 4.2.8 3.65.8 3c0-.65.55-1.2 1.2-1.2.65 0 1.2.55 1.2 1.2 0 .65-.55 1.2-1.2 1.2z\"></path></svg>\n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-info-container\">\n\n\n\n      <h4>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/pull/22000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">feat: added app_include_icons to add custom icons</a>\n      </h4>\n\n    <div class=\"branches\">\n      <code>frappe:develop</code> ← <code>kalungia:develop</code>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"github-info\">\n        <div class=\"date\">\n          opened <span class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2023-08-10\" data-time=\"00:39:12\" data-timezone=\"UTC\">12:39AM - 10 Aug 23 UTC</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"user\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/kalungia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n            <img alt=\"kalungia\" src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85731451?v=4\" class=\"onebox-avatar-inline\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n            kalungia\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"lines\" title=\"1 commits changed 5 files with 1017 additions and 1 deletions\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/pull/22000/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n            <span class=\"added\">+1017</span>\n            <span class=\"removed\">-1</span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-row\">\n    <p class=\"github-body-container\">I added app_include_icons so that one can add custom svg icons on app. This only<span class=\"show-more-container\"><a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/pull/22000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" class=\"show-more\">…</a></span><span class=\"excerpt hidden\"> works on the app and not the website.\n\nTo add a custom icon create an HTML file in public and add the icons in this format {`&lt;symbol viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" id=\"icon-idname\" &gt;&lt;path/&gt;&lt;/symbol&gt;`}.\nThen include the icon file in the hooks `app_include_icons =\"public/icons/timeless/icons.html\"`</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
